//! BENCH-027: stratification of `p :- notin p` (Evita Raced's metaprogrammed stratifier, R01 T21).
//!
//! Evita computes strata with Overlog rules over the program catalog (`stratify.olg`); a program with
//! `p :- notin p` gets stratum infinity and is rejected. Blossom's stratifier (ANA-002, SEM-022) runs over the
//! same dependency information and rejects it with the cycle as witness.

program evita_self_negation version 1;

output answer();

view p() = not p();                         // expect: BLS0502

report: while p() {
    emit answer();
}
